OL,3,AMacron accuses foreign leaders of
OL,4,Aexploiting French riots
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,7,Faccused foreign leaders of exploiting
OL,8,Fthe riots which erupted across the
OL,9,Fcountry on Saturday for electoral
OL,10,Fpurposes.
OL,12,FWithout naming them, he said they were
OL,13,Fcampaigning for forthcoming elections
OL,14,F"at France's expense" with their
OL,15,Fcomments on the violence, which erupted
OL,16,Fon the fringe of cost-of-living
OL,17,Fprotests.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
